    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:tallith/mah_yaqar" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n38.jpg">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="36"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/36/8" n="8"/>How precious is Thy grace, O God, and the children of man shelter in the shadow of Thy wings. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/36/9" n="9"/>They are refreshed by the felicity of Thy house and with the brook of Thy bliss dost Thou water them. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/36/10" n="10"/>For with Thee is the source of life, in Thy light do we behold light. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/36/11" n="11"/>Extend Thy grace to those who acknowledge Thee, and Thy charity to those who are of upright heart. <tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
